				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Alter illorum <persName>Titus Amicinus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nomine Coronensis <placeName>Transsylvanus</placeName> patria <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>est, alter vero <persName>Ioannes Ferinarius</persName> Novoforensis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Silesianus<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">s. Manfred P. Fleischer, Späthumanismus in Schlesien, S. 126f u. Reg.</note>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">E <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberga</placeName> vivente adhuc <persName>Philippo</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>discesserunt et per <placeName>Belgas</placeName> profecti <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>perlustrarunt, ex qua se nunc in has regiones <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ad ecclesias nostras invisendas conferunt.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Pie et <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>bene sentiunt de ecclesiis nostris et earum doctrin<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>a sic a praeceptori suo, ut ipsi praedicant, in<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>stituti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Non dubito, quin illos pro humanitate <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>solita liberaliter et honorifice sitis excepturi.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nos <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>quoque ipsis praestitimus, quod potuimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Habent illi se<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>cum historiam tumultus <persName>Gallici</persName> impressam, quam <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>si prius non videris, libenter tibi communicabunt.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Quod alias scribam, non habeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Expectamus, quid <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>nostri ex comitiis <placeName ref="l21">Badensibus</placeName> afferant.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Dominus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><persName>Wurstenbergerus</persName> valde praedicat vestram liberalitatem <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et honorificentiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quae tractentur ab adversariis <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>consilia, non ignoras; sed non dormitat, qui <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>custodit suos; ipsi sit laus in aeternum!</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Dissipet <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>deinceps quoque dominus consilia <persName>Ahitophelium</persName>, quod et <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>faciet.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Bene vale cum tuis omnibus, quibus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>una cum fratribus et symmystis omnibus salutem <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>dicas meo nomine.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 7. iulii 1560.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I[oan<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>nes] H[allerus</persName>] tuus perpetuo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae pastori <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>fidelissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>et compatri suo per<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>petuo observando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>